      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003470
    m_Localized: One day I was washing the car with my son, he turned to me and said "Dad why can't you just use a sponge instead?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003469
    m_Localized: Why do Norwegian ships have barcodes on them? So when they come in to port, they can... Scandinavian
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003468
    m_Localized: "Two parrots are sitting on a perch.\nOne says to the other, \u201Cdo you smell fish?\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003467
    m_Localized: 'Why can''t you hear Pterry the pterodactyl going to the bathroom?

      His "p" is silent.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003466
    m_Localized: 'Did you hear about the mathematician who''s afraid of negative numbers?

      He''ll stop at nothing to avoid them.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003465
    m_Localized: "Why does a circle have 360\xB0?\nIt spent way too much time at university."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003464
    m_Localized: "What\u2019s the difference between a diameter and a radius?\nA radius."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003463
    m_Localized: 'Elevator puns really push my buttons.

      They let me down.


      They are bad on so many levels.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003462
    m_Localized: "Why do they call them lifts in the UK & elevators in the US?\nBecause we\u2019re raised differently."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003461
    m_Localized: "I\u2019m terrified of elevators\u2026 I\u2019ve been taking steps to avoid them."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003460
    m_Localized: 'Why do sharks live in salt water?

      Pepper water makes them sneeze.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003459
    m_Localized: "Why did the chicken go to the s\xE9ance?\nTo get to the other side."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003458
    m_Localized: 'Did you hear? I invented a new word!

      "plagiarism"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003457
    m_Localized: 'What kind of tree fits in your hand?

      A palm tree'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003456
    m_Localized: 'What do you call a guy who never farts in public?

      A private tutor'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003455
    m_Localized: 'Why did the kid throw a stick of butter out the window?

      To see a butter-fly'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003454
    m_Localized: 'What does the bi-lingual cat say?

      Woof'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003453
    m_Localized: 'What does the ocean say when looking at a bowl of salt?

      I sea salt'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003452
    m_Localized: 'What''s the difference between a hot sweet potato and a pig thrown out the window?

      One is a heated yam and the other is a yeeted ham. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003451
    m_Localized: 'Why do seagulls fly near the Sea?

      Because if they flew near the bay, they would be bagels.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003450
    m_Localized: "Why do divers fall backward out of boats?\nBecause if they fell forward, they\u2019d still be in the boat."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003449
    m_Localized: I have a coffee bean that sits next to me at work. We don't get a lot of work done; he talks a latte.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003448
    m_Localized: What do you call a flower that runs on electricity? A power plant.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003447
    m_Localized: Who is Jack and why does he have a singular mento?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003446
    m_Localized: At what point does a joke become a dad joke? When it becomes apparent
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003445
    m_Localized: Saw someone stopping on a bun the other day. He was on a roll
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003444
    m_Localized: I asked the farmer why he was having a headache  He replied "My grains"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003443
    m_Localized: Why did the Mexican throw his wife off the bridge?  Tequila!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003442
    m_Localized: "I know 25 letters of alphabet   I don\u2019t know y"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003441
    m_Localized: What happens when someone slaps you at a high frequency?  It hertz
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003440
    m_Localized: I threw my neighbor into a nuclear reactor and now he's dead. What should I do?!  Barium
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003439
    m_Localized: What do you call a weaponized fish?  A pike
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003438
    m_Localized: You hear about this new restaurant karma?  They have no menu, you get what you deserve
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003437
    m_Localized: What did batman order at the bar?  Just ice
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003436
    m_Localized: I was going to tell y'all a joke about time travel, but you didn't like it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003435
    m_Localized: What do you call a werewolf youtuber? A lycansubscribe
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003434
    m_Localized: I spotted an albino dalmatian once.  it was the least I could do
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003433
    m_Localized: I, for one, like roman numerals
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003432
    m_Localized: Cargo space? No. Cargo road
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003431
    m_Localized: What do you call a woman with one leg? Eileen
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
