  - m_Id: 87000000000003074
    m_Localized: Console
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003073
    m_Localized: Loading...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003072
    m_Localized: Meet me back in town, I have something special to give you, and I need you to help me get some logs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003071
    m_Localized: But I need the perfect timber for my house...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003070
    m_Localized: 'I came out here looking for some trees to fell. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003069
    m_Localized: Nyeh heh heh, adventurer.  I am the witch, who will teach you how to tend to the soil.  What, you thought I was going to make potions for you?  Get out of here with your stereotyping.  And bring back five fully grown radishes.  As proof, definitely not for my radish jam.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003068
    m_Localized: I'm going back to my mines. Meet me there if you want to see some real ORE!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003067
    m_Localized: HE FAILED TO MENTION IT WAS THIS HUNK OF JUNK!!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003066
    m_Localized: Hmmph... when Barkley told me there was ore out here...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003065
    m_Localized: Eva wants how many radishes!?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003064
    m_Localized: We could really use your help dealing with them...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003063
    m_Localized: But it seems the slimes have come further than usual.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003062
    m_Localized: We came out here looking for some new seeds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003061
    m_Localized: Pleasure to meet ya
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003060
    m_Localized: Heres a sword I made! I'm heading back to town.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003059
    m_Localized: 'Think I am better fitted to crafting gear than fighting these guys. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87000000000003058
    m_Localized: 'Oh there you are bro! '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
